Cell["\<\
The one-argument form does no normalization at all, so two inert words that \
are rotations of one another are different expressions. Normalize with the \
two-argument form before comparing.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"62516a57-c5e8-4fa9-8485-ee47f9893f68"],

